SUMMARY:Pupalooza
DESCRIPTION:Durham Parks and Recreation (DPR) invites you and your four-legged best friend to Pupalooza\, our newest fall event for pups and their people! Spend the day enjoying live music\, creative activities\, local vendors\, food and plenty of opportunities to let your pup steal the show. \nWhether your dog loves making new friends\, dressing up or simply spending the day by your side\, Pupalooza is a celebration you won’t want to miss! \nSaturday\, October 24\, 2026\n3:30pm-6:30pm\nDurham Central Park\n501 Foster Street
