SUMMARY:Phone Free Fun
DESCRIPTION:Want to escape the screens? Need desperately to put your phone down but find it too challenging? Take this opportunity to bond with your friends while everyone sets their cell aside – to hang out old school\, just like in the 90’s. \nHappening all day every Sunday\, you just leave your phone with the bartender who will securely keep them safe. Each beverage you purchase\, you get a raffle ticket\, which enters you into a raffle drawing done on the last Sunday of every month for cool swag! \nDid we mention all bottles of wine are 25% off all day Sundays? So by unplugging\, you can win in more than one way – come give it a try! \nView on Facebook.
