SUMMARY:North Carolina Save Hemp Tour: High Times Hemp Fest
DESCRIPTION:Durham\, we’re bringing the HIGH TIMES H#MP BEV FEST to Motorco Music Hall on Sunday\, October 25! Join us for a FREE afternoon of live music from Save Tonight\, a 90s & 00s tribute band\, food\, local vendors\, beverage tastings\, consumer education and more! \nWe’re teaming up with The CannaJo!nt and HIGH TIMES Magazine as part of the North Carolina Save H#MP Tour\, raising awareness about legislation that could impact access to h#mp products beginning December 11. Come discover new beverage brands\, grab a tasting pass (21+) and vote for your favorites in the High Times People’s Choice Awards! We’ll also have Dr. DorothyBelle “DB” Poli\, Director of Cannabis Studies at Roanoke College\, sharing information about the endocannabinoid system\, responsible consumption and the science behind the plant. \nA big thank you to Apotheca\, our Main Stage Sponsor\, for helping make this event possible! \nSUNDAY\, OCTOBER 25 | 3–8 PM | FREE ENTRY! Everyone is welcome\, whether you’re curious about h#mp\, already enjoy the products or just want to catch some great live music! Get all the details at THECANNAJOINT.COM Come hang out\, have some fun and help SAVE H#MP!
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/north-carolina-save-hemp-tour-high-times-hemp-fest/
LOCATION:Motorco\, 723 Rigsbee\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/HighTimesSaveHempTour_Motorco_1080x1350-1187x1536-1.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Motorco":MAILTO:noreply@facebookmail.com
GEO:36.003527;-78.900332
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Motorco 723 Rigsbee Durham NC 27701 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=723 Rigsbee:geo:-78.900332,36.003527
END:VEVENT
