SUMMARY:Spooky Tales & Tasty Ales
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to share and be scared! You’ve been waiting for the right moment to tell that one terrifying ghost story you have\, right? We’ll since it’s almost Halloween\, there’s no better time than now for a Ghost Story Open Mic. \nEnjoy our special cocktail of the evening\, a S’mores Martini\, the perfect accompaniment to your ghostly night of thrilling tales. Or try our one of our locally brewed Glass Jug beers\, cocktails\, THC lemonades and more! \nYour host Ash will be there with spooky stories of her own and to help you be brave enough to share. Bring your storytelling skills to weave a scary story or tell a true tell from firsthand experience – no matter what you’ll leave entertained. So grab a brew and a seat and get scared! \nView on Facebook.
