SUMMARY:Magic The Gathering Cube Night at DSSOLVR
DESCRIPTION:Join us at DSSOLVR to draft Magic the Gathering Vintage Cube at 6:30 PM every 4th Monday of the month! \nEvery 4th Monday of the month at 6:30 PM at DSSOLVR Durham\, we will be hosting a free-to-play Magic the Gathering Vintage Cube\, and we want YOU to join us! \nVintage Cube is the best way to play with iconic cards from Magic’s 30+ year history. We will draft from a randomized collection of packs from the Vintage Cube\, build decks out of those cards\, and battle each other through multiple rounds. \nThe winner of the event each night will take home a sweet trophy card signed by all the players in the draft and even get one drink on the house! \nThis event has no entry fee– simply show up to play\, enjoy great craft beers\, and have a good time! \nThe updated list of cards for the cube is at the link below: \nhttps://cubecobra.com/cube/list/0705a9fc-c632-4cf9-b8c2-eedd55dfb1fa \nDSSOLVR Info: \nWeekly Monday drink special of $5 light beers & $5 hard ginger beers \nWi-Fi – Free guest Wi-Fi available.\nMenu – Menu has rotating options of beer\, liquor/cocktails\, cider\, Gluten free beers\, hard ginger beer\, Jell-O shots\, and extensive non-alcoholic offerings!\nTVs – 4 TVs – request to put on any game or show!\nDogs – Dog Friendly inside taproom & outside on covered patio (we have toys\, beds\, & water bowls!)\nFamily – Family friendly w/ high chair\, changing table\, and sensory toys for kids.\nGames – Free to play board games\, N64\, NES\, and arcade games\nFood – Snacks & cup of noodles available on site. Several food delivery & carry out options available within a 2 block radius.\nParking – Standard downtown parking options available. Street parking all around (free after 7 pm and on Sat/Sun. Free gravel parking lot next to Welcome tattoo. Free parking along residential streets back towards Durty Bull. Paid parking lots in Liberty Apartment building and next to Geer House Apartments.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/magic-the-gathering-cube-night-at-dssolvr/2026-10-26/
LOCATION:DSSOLVR\, 630 Rigsbee Ave\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Brewery,Competition,Free,Game Night,Prizes
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Monday-Magic-graphic-2025.jpg
